# Sample environment for the live Alpaca paths (ADR-0018).
#
#   cp .env.example .env      # then fill in your PAPER keys below
#
# `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` (this file) is committed and must never
# contain a real key. Nothing in the bench reads this file automatically -- load
# it into your shell for the commands that need it:
#
#   set -a; . .env; set +a
#
# Only the live Alpaca paths need these: `--source alpaca`,
# `trading paper --broker alpaca --live`, `trading verify-universe`, and the
# credential-gated tests in tests/integration/. Every offline path (synthetic,
# csv, yfinance, the whole fast gate) runs without them.
#
# PAPER KEYS ONLY. Generate them at https://app.alpaca.markets/paper/dashboard/overview
# -> "API Keys". RealAlpacaClient defaults to `paper=True` and the CLI never
# overrides it, but a live-funded key still does not belong in this bench.
ALPACA_API_KEY=
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=

# Also needs the optional SDK, which is NOT installed by a plain `uv sync`:
#
#   uv sync --extra alpaca
